            "paragraph": "We include CO2 emissions from both fossil fuel combustion (i.e. energy-related emissions) and cement production (process-related emissions) in the emission accounts. Energy-related CO2 emissions are converted from the carbon content in fossil fuels, such as raw coal and gasoline during combustion.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
